WEBVTT

00:00:06.780 --> 00:00:13.180
A blue sky before the end of the rainy season

00:00:06.780 --> 00:00:13.180
Tsuyu ake mae no aozora wa...

00:00:07.010 --> 00:00:15.370
I, My, Me! - Strawberry-eggs

00:00:13.590 --> 00:00:21.100
makes a heart dance with expectation

00:00:13.590 --> 00:00:21.100
hitoashi hayaku kokoro wo odoraseru

00:00:22.520 --> 00:00:28.580
Summer is coming yet again

00:00:22.520 --> 00:00:28.580
Kotoshi mo mosugu natsuga kuru

00:00:29.570 --> 00:00:37.010
The city and people are coming to life bursting with joy

00:00:29.570 --> 00:00:37.010
Machi mo hito mo ukare kibun de zawameki dasu

00:00:38.580 --> 00:00:46.130
A man who's grown up without losing his boyish heart

00:00:38.580 --> 00:00:46.130
Shonen no kokoro no mama otona ni natta hito

00:00:46.630 --> 00:00:54.860
We can't go back to the day we met for the first time, but...

00:00:46.630 --> 00:00:54.860
Futari deatta anohi ni modorenai kedo...

00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:04.600
If I close my eyes, I can see your smiling face

00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:04.600
Hitomi wo tojireba hohoemu kao ga mieru

00:01:04.810 --> 00:01:12.510
The song we both loved. Do you still sing it?

00:01:04.810 --> 00:01:12.510
Daisuki na ano uta. Ima mo utatte masuka?

00:01:12.510 --> 00:01:20.350
I can still hear that gentle voice and melody

00:01:12.510 --> 00:01:20.350
Watashi ni wa kikoeru. Yasashii koe to melody

00:01:20.350 --> 00:01:29.630
During times of sadness, I will remember you

00:01:20.350 --> 00:01:29.630
Yowaki na toki hodo anata wo omoidasu

00:01:32.220 --> 00:01:36.870
Kaitaku City General Hospital

00:01:39.560 --> 00:01:40.570
As you wish.

00:01:41.010 --> 00:01:43.490
I'll see to it the entire staff
treats the patient as a female.

00:01:48.670 --> 00:01:48.710
Ms.
Hibiki
Amawa

00:02:00.840 --> 00:02:03.750
I love you, Sensei.

00:02:08.500 --> 00:02:11.650
I love... Sensei.

00:02:14.280 --> 00:02:20.290
12th Period
Cleansing Shock of Deception

00:02:32.510 --> 00:02:34.260
I'll wait until you're sure.

00:02:35.330 --> 00:02:37.640
I don't have to give up
at least till then, do I?

00:02:41.450 --> 00:02:42.810
Am I stupid?

00:02:43.360 --> 00:02:45.110
Sensei is a woman.

00:02:50.780 --> 00:02:52.100
Uh, hi.

00:02:52.750 --> 00:02:54.020
You're still here.

00:02:56.080 --> 00:02:56.620
Yeah.

00:02:57.240 --> 00:02:59.740
Uh, I left something here.

00:03:01.300 --> 00:03:02.330
Sensei...

00:03:04.120 --> 00:03:06.970
I'm a little worried
about Sensei's injury.

00:03:07.500 --> 00:03:09.960
Do you mind stopping by
to see her on the way home?

00:03:15.060 --> 00:03:18.150
Fuko's been taking care
of her all this time.

00:03:18.220 --> 00:03:20.320
So... so what!?

00:03:25.630 --> 00:03:26.340
Sorry...

00:03:29.580 --> 00:03:31.220
Is the person she's in love with?

00:03:36.220 --> 00:03:36.980
Nothing!

00:03:39.990 --> 00:03:41.800
Ms.
Hibiki
Amawa

00:03:40.630 --> 00:03:41.950
Ms. Hibiki Amawa
Hibiki Amawa...

00:03:45.020 --> 00:03:45.960
This is it.

00:03:49.420 --> 00:03:50.290
Target captured!

00:03:50.610 --> 00:03:52.710
W... w... what is this!?

00:03:52.800 --> 00:03:54.020
Kochi-san, your pants...

00:03:55.720 --> 00:03:55.760
No Visitors

00:03:56.400 --> 00:03:57.420
Hey, what are you doing!?

00:03:57.420 --> 00:03:58.200
Let me out!

00:03:57.700 --> 00:03:59.290
Here we go, Mori-chan.

00:03:59.550 --> 00:04:00.920
What's going on!?

00:04:01.870 --> 00:04:04.030
Let me out, I said!

00:04:08.560 --> 00:04:10.030
Are they Amawa's accomplices?

00:04:33.960 --> 00:04:34.800
Kuzuha...

00:04:35.570 --> 00:04:36.700
Sensei!

00:04:36.740 --> 00:04:38.040
You've come around!

00:04:38.290 --> 00:04:39.520
I'm so glad.

00:04:42.860 --> 00:04:43.260
Yeah...

00:04:45.450 --> 00:04:47.350
Kuzuha! Were you hurt!?

00:04:47.620 --> 00:04:49.280
Just a little burn.

00:04:50.040 --> 00:04:51.320
Tiny little bit, really.

00:04:54.220 --> 00:04:55.100
I see.

00:04:56.800 --> 00:04:58.180
Sensei, I'm sorry.

00:04:58.380 --> 00:05:00.370
You are injured because of me.

00:05:00.520 --> 00:05:01.580
Oh, no.

00:05:01.810 --> 00:05:03.790
It was my own misunderstanding.

00:05:04.280 --> 00:05:09.350
It was Gochiso's Obaa-chan
and Kura Ge who saved us.

00:05:09.930 --> 00:05:10.930
It was?

00:05:12.130 --> 00:05:15.030
I have to bring some nice
bones as a token of thanks.

00:05:15.030 --> 00:05:16.380
I love you, Sensei...

00:05:17.630 --> 00:05:19.630
Stop having wild obsessions.

00:05:19.880 --> 00:05:21.070
Ow!

00:05:21.660 --> 00:05:22.670
Sensei!

00:05:23.260 --> 00:05:24.550
Ouch...

00:05:24.550 --> 00:05:25.580
Are you alright?

00:06:15.170 --> 00:06:18.360
Ah, you came all the way to see me?

00:06:19.120 --> 00:06:20.360
Have a seat, here.

00:06:31.790 --> 00:06:34.120
I'll go get something to drink.

00:06:37.690 --> 00:06:39.380
Sorry for worrying you.

00:06:39.770 --> 00:06:40.650
But I'll be out tomo...

00:06:40.650 --> 00:06:42.230
I'm not worried.

00:06:46.850 --> 00:06:47.740
I'm sorry.

00:06:57.870 --> 00:06:58.730
Sensei.

00:07:01.750 --> 00:07:04.440
I never knew a woman
could actually...

00:07:05.540 --> 00:07:06.880
fall in love with another woman.

00:07:30.210 --> 00:07:32.340
Thanks for walking me home.

00:07:34.110 --> 00:07:34.730
It's nothing.

00:07:37.520 --> 00:07:38.450
Fukae-kun.

00:07:43.180 --> 00:07:45.700
About what you said the other day...

00:07:53.820 --> 00:07:56.040
Now I know...

00:07:57.560 --> 00:07:59.240
who I'm in love with.

00:08:00.070 --> 00:08:02.090
And how much I love that person.

00:08:03.470 --> 00:08:04.250
So...

00:08:05.210 --> 00:08:05.940
I'm sorry.

00:08:08.530 --> 00:08:10.080
Don't apologize for that.

00:08:14.830 --> 00:08:15.610
Thank you.

00:08:21.650 --> 00:08:25.970
Because of you I came to realize
what my true feelings are.

00:08:26.520 --> 00:08:28.420
So, thank you.

00:08:31.660 --> 00:08:32.840
If that's the case...

00:08:34.470 --> 00:08:35.590
I'm an idiot.

00:08:48.170 --> 00:08:51.160
You are back to your normal
cheerful self, Fujio-san.

00:08:52.190 --> 00:08:53.940
Was I not cheerful before?

00:08:54.190 --> 00:08:56.250
No you were not.

00:08:56.790 --> 00:08:57.590
No way.

00:08:57.690 --> 00:08:59.290
You know nothing ever troubles me.

00:09:00.130 --> 00:09:01.920
Oh, this comic is so funny!!

00:09:03.920 --> 00:09:04.720
Especially this part!

00:09:04.720 --> 00:09:06.190
Oh, you're home, Fuko.

00:09:10.400 --> 00:09:11.140
Hello...

00:09:13.450 --> 00:09:14.990
How was Sensei?

00:09:15.330 --> 00:09:17.840
We refrained ourselves
from going there...

00:09:17.840 --> 00:09:20.260
thinking too many
visitors would tire her out...

00:09:22.020 --> 00:09:23.790
She'll be released soon.

00:09:42.340 --> 00:09:43.740
Did something happen?

00:09:48.120 --> 00:09:51.780
Fukae-kun came to the hospital.

00:09:53.580 --> 00:09:57.370
I did something terrible.

00:09:59.030 --> 00:10:01.100
I wonder if you can never
fall in love with someone...

00:10:01.590 --> 00:10:03.650
without hurting someone else.

00:10:05.510 --> 00:10:10.890
And yet you can't stop feeling love.

00:10:13.910 --> 00:10:14.580
Fuko.

00:10:21.370 --> 00:10:23.400
Kuzuha loves...

00:10:25.260 --> 00:10:29.700
No, not me as a man but
Hibiki Amawa as a woman.

00:10:31.070 --> 00:10:36.200
But I know I was Hibiki Amawa
the man at that moment.

00:11:10.250 --> 00:11:11.440
I'm a fool!

00:11:34.950 --> 00:11:37.150
It's nice to hear
about Hibiki-sensei.

00:11:37.700 --> 00:11:39.930
She is already returning
to school today.

00:11:40.130 --> 00:11:42.080
I know! I'm so happy!

00:11:42.870 --> 00:11:45.600
I baked cookies using
the Housemother's recipe.

00:11:46.260 --> 00:11:49.090
I can't wait to give these
as a welcome-back present.

00:11:49.250 --> 00:11:52.050
Sounds like you're
giving them to your lover.

00:11:53.020 --> 00:11:53.660
Oops...

00:11:55.970 --> 00:11:58.950
Hey Fuko, of course I'm joking.

00:11:59.330 --> 00:12:02.980
First of all, Sensei's a woman;
don't turn red like that.

00:12:04.440 --> 00:12:05.610
Uh, yeah. Right.

00:12:06.770 --> 00:12:08.660
Is the person she's in love with?

00:12:10.250 --> 00:12:11.240
It can't be.

00:12:17.130 --> 00:12:22.220
What is this special announcement
the Vice-Principal was speaking of?

00:12:22.370 --> 00:12:23.810
You will find out in a while.

00:12:24.250 --> 00:12:26.150
But Director Tokugawa.

00:12:27.370 --> 00:12:30.000
I'll have you officially decide
today that this school...

00:12:30.330 --> 00:12:33.000
is to become a girls-only facility.

00:12:37.100 --> 00:12:38.900
Now, let us begin
the morning meeting.

00:12:39.210 --> 00:12:43.020
First of all, we will hear
a word from Amawa-sensei...

00:12:43.020 --> 00:12:44.950
who has returned from
her absence due to injury.

00:12:45.530 --> 00:12:47.210
Amawa-sensei, please.

00:12:56.500 --> 00:12:57.800
Quiet down!

00:12:58.630 --> 00:13:03.450
Before that, however,
I have an important announcement.

00:13:04.260 --> 00:13:05.180
All of you know that...

00:13:05.180 --> 00:13:08.060
in accordance to the Principal's
supreme educational philosophy...

00:13:08.060 --> 00:13:11.720
only females are allowed
to teach in our school.

00:13:11.890 --> 00:13:12.870
However!

00:13:12.970 --> 00:13:17.800
It became clear that Amawa-sensei here
is unqualified to teach in our school!

00:13:19.670 --> 00:13:21.610
What's she talking about?

00:13:24.390 --> 00:13:28.200
Amawa-sensei here is a male!

00:13:32.630 --> 00:13:34.900
That's impossible no matter
how you look at her.

00:13:35.330 --> 00:13:39.340
If Hibiki-chan was a man, there'd
be no real women in this world.

00:13:39.580 --> 00:13:41.100
My, my...

00:13:41.340 --> 00:13:43.720
That's a good joke
for the Vice-Principal.

00:13:44.040 --> 00:13:46.150
It's been rather hot lately.

00:14:05.820 --> 00:14:07.450
Look at this!

00:14:07.530 --> 00:14:09.560
This shameful sight!

00:14:24.840 --> 00:14:26.010
Bra-Man...

00:14:27.000 --> 00:14:28.100
You've got to be kidding.

00:14:29.770 --> 00:14:31.010
Impossible...

00:14:32.010 --> 00:14:34.320
This man disguised himself...

00:14:34.320 --> 00:14:36.600
to give our female students
a false sense of security...

00:14:36.600 --> 00:14:40.020
with the intent of
performing filthy acts.

00:14:44.540 --> 00:14:46.010
That's gross.

00:14:46.040 --> 00:14:47.120
Disgusting.

00:14:47.120 --> 00:14:48.660
Unbelievable; that's filthy.

00:14:48.660 --> 00:14:49.310
Stop it!

00:14:49.440 --> 00:14:50.920
Kuzuha has nothing to do with it!!

00:14:51.300 --> 00:14:52.670
Yes, the voice!

00:14:53.230 --> 00:14:54.830
It's that of a female!

00:14:58.270 --> 00:15:02.420
That's because of this choker.
He was changing the voice with this!

00:15:05.450 --> 00:15:08.630
Here, Amawa-sensei,
thank you for waiting.

00:15:09.080 --> 00:15:11.580
Why don't you greet everyone now?

00:15:21.280 --> 00:15:24.190
The microphone has the   same  device
..     as the choker  inside.

00:15:37.370 --> 00:15:39.520
Go ahead, Amawa-sensei.

00:16:09.600 --> 00:16:10.730
Wait a moment.

00:16:12.720 --> 00:16:13.830
This is yours.

00:16:50.210 --> 00:16:53.070
We now end today's
urgent morning meeting.

00:16:53.600 --> 00:16:57.680
Each Class is to quickly go
back to their classroom in lines.

00:17:00.100 --> 00:17:02.830
It is unbelievable! It was a man!

00:17:02.830 --> 00:17:04.350
Not only that, it was Bra Man!

00:17:04.770 --> 00:17:06.130
We've been deceived!

00:17:06.130 --> 00:17:09.230
Director, I believe
you finally see it now.

00:17:09.690 --> 00:17:14.150
As to how a creature called male could
have a harmful effect on education.

00:17:14.420 --> 00:17:15.720
My Hibiki-chan!!

00:17:15.720 --> 00:17:16.940
A nightmare!

00:17:17.050 --> 00:17:17.540
However...

00:17:17.540 --> 00:17:21.050
It is a good opportunity to convert
Seitow Sannomiya Private School...

00:17:21.050 --> 00:17:22.680
to a chaste and proper girls' school.

00:17:22.680 --> 00:17:23.800
That's absurd!

00:17:24.080 --> 00:17:25.660
Really, it's just like a man.

00:17:25.660 --> 00:17:26.370
What!?

00:17:26.430 --> 00:17:28.890
There should be no such creatures
as males in this world!!

00:17:29.010 --> 00:17:30.040
That's too extreme!

00:17:30.230 --> 00:17:32.870
Such an educational environment
cannot benefit the students!

00:17:32.910 --> 00:17:35.190
How insulting!
Don't lump all males in with him!!

00:17:35.380 --> 00:17:38.430
What, you were all over him going
"Sensei, Sensei," all the time.

00:17:38.540 --> 00:17:40.300
Of course our students here...

00:17:40.300 --> 00:17:42.620
and their families
have a right to choose.

00:17:42.690 --> 00:17:44.600
It was just because
we'd been deceived!

00:17:44.640 --> 00:17:46.650
You were the ones going
"Hibiki-chan, Hibiki-chan,"...

00:17:46.650 --> 00:17:49.010
losing your heads,
just because he looked like a woman!

00:17:49.110 --> 00:17:51.060
Let's put it to a vote
at a school assembly.

00:17:51.360 --> 00:17:52.850
That should be fair enough?

00:17:53.000 --> 00:17:54.340
Had I known it was a man...

00:17:54.340 --> 00:17:55.800
I wouldn't have gone
anywhere near him!!

00:17:55.800 --> 00:17:58.680
Neither would we! No way!
That perv Bra Man!

00:18:04.330 --> 00:18:05.620
Men, loathsome creatures...

00:18:13.540 --> 00:18:15.590
Why didn't you use the microphone?

00:18:24.600 --> 00:18:26.630
I couldn't deceive them any longer...

00:18:28.240 --> 00:18:30.210
my students.

00:18:31.950 --> 00:18:34.090
It was stupid; now you're fired.

00:18:37.440 --> 00:18:38.200
Tomorrow...

00:18:38.970 --> 00:18:39.880
I'll vacate the room.

00:18:44.890 --> 00:18:46.630
That's not what I'm talking about.

00:18:52.390 --> 00:18:53.310
I...

00:18:54.260 --> 00:18:55.710
really loved Sensei.

00:18:58.810 --> 00:19:03.140
I didn't care if she was a woman,
or if she thought I was twisted...

00:19:04.600 --> 00:19:06.310
or what other people thought.

00:19:07.710 --> 00:19:09.340
I still loved her.

00:19:11.130 --> 00:19:12.060
It's true...

00:19:22.880 --> 00:19:24.900
Good thing for you
she's a man, cutie!

00:19:24.940 --> 00:19:26.600
But a woman is OK with you too, huh?

00:19:26.710 --> 00:19:27.710
Hey you!

00:19:27.710 --> 00:19:28.910
Hey, cutie!

00:19:32.640 --> 00:19:35.430
What does a shit like you understand!?

00:19:36.370 --> 00:19:38.560
You don't know how Kuzuha feels!!

00:19:39.080 --> 00:19:40.030
Stop it! Fukae!

00:19:40.170 --> 00:19:42.640
A shit like you don't know
how it feels to love someone!!

00:19:42.640 --> 00:19:44.070
How it hurts!!

00:19:44.070 --> 00:19:44.720
Stop it!!

00:19:46.090 --> 00:19:48.810
You’re just playing into the
Principal and the others' hands!

00:19:48.810 --> 00:19:51.480
Or how it feels not
being loved in return!!

00:20:06.140 --> 00:20:06.740
Why...

00:20:08.070 --> 00:20:10.310
Why did he have to betray Fuko?

00:20:20.680 --> 00:20:21.520
Fukae!!

00:20:34.510 --> 00:20:36.880
Just forget everything
about a Sensei like that.

00:20:37.270 --> 00:20:39.760
Think she never existed.

00:20:40.690 --> 00:20:41.850
I don't know.

00:20:44.610 --> 00:20:47.320
I wonder if my feeling...

00:20:47.930 --> 00:20:49.750
never existed, either.

00:21:11.320 --> 00:21:18.070
At the train station after school
that's where I look for you

00:21:11.320 --> 00:21:18.070
Hokago no eki kimi wo sagasu.

00:21:11.850 --> 00:21:17.910
This is why we pirate. Imagine sitting there for like a week now, wondering wtf happens next. Holyyyyy shieeeet

00:21:18.180 --> 00:21:27.430
With my racing heart
can I find you again today?

00:21:18.180 --> 00:21:27.430
Doki doki shiteru
kyo mo aeru kana?

00:21:42.600 --> 00:21:49.390
At this train station
I saw you many times before

00:21:42.600 --> 00:21:49.390
Eki no homu de
mikakete ta kimi.

00:21:49.550 --> 00:21:56.280
But couldn't talk to you
Not at all

00:21:49.550 --> 00:21:56.280
Hajime wa nanimo hanase nakatta.

00:21:56.430 --> 00:22:03.130
Will I find you again tomorrow?

00:21:56.430 --> 00:22:03.130
Moshimo ashita aetara iina?

00:22:03.270 --> 00:22:11.110
Maybe I'll have enough
courage to talk to you

00:22:03.270 --> 00:22:11.110
Youki dashite ieru kamone.

00:22:11.300 --> 00:22:18.240
Even if the sky cries

00:22:11.300 --> 00:22:18.240
Tatoeba sora ga namida shitemo...

00:22:18.240 --> 00:22:27.080
with your smile it's
a sunny day in my eyes

00:22:18.240 --> 00:22:27.080
kimi no egao de hitomi wa hareru yo.

00:22:38.380 --> 00:22:53.390
13th Period
"Someday, Without Makeup as Promised"

00:22:38.660 --> 00:22:39.400
Woof! Woof!

00:22:39.400 --> 00:22:41.440
You say you want to join
the homeroom too, Kura Ge?

00:22:41.440 --> 00:22:41.880
Woof! Woof!

00:22:41.880 --> 00:22:44.000
Right, I was on every time,
but in your case...

00:22:44.000 --> 00:22:45.640
OK, Kura Ge, you do the next one!

00:22:45.640 --> 00:22:47.420
But tomorrow is the last episode.

00:22:47.420 --> 00:22:48.290
Yeah, I know...

00:22:48.290 --> 00:22:51.010
Oh! Kura-Ge can talk?
